}],"title":"Going further with more resources","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"kind":"hero"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"contentSection":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"mediaPosition":"trailing","kind":"contentAndMedia"}],"anchor":"More-resources","title":"More resources","stepsSection":[{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can get it at ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as libraries) with details about everything: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","code":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-1.png","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Go to the website and learn things at ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icon finder"}]},{"text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","code":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-2.png","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Have a look ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki","isActive":true},{"text":" to discover how OUDS works.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technical architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","code":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-3.png","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For technical reasons the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","isActive":true},{"text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"design system toolbox"}]},{"text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","code":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-4.png","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not hesitate to ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/issues","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions","isActive":true},{"text":"!","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS is open source, public and uses GitHub as forge. Thus, you will find common things inside the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","isActive":true},{"text":" GitHub repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","code":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-5.png","runtimePreview":null}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-lime-10-going-further"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"project","references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-lime-9-tuning#Check-Your-Understanding":{"title":"Check Your Understanding","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Check Your Understanding","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-lime-9-tuning#Check-Your-Understanding","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-9-tuning#Check-Your-Understanding"},"https://unified-design-system.orange.com/":{"title":"unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/","identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-lime-5-spacings#Overriding-spacing-tokens":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Spacing tokens control margins and paddings throughout the app. In this chapter, we will override spacing tokens to customize the layout spacing."}],"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-lime-5-spacings#Overriding-spacing-tokens","type":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-5-spacings#Overriding-spacing-tokens","role":"pseudoSymbol","title":"Overriding spacing tokens","kind":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-lime-4-borders":{"title":"Borders","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Borders can be defined with line width, style, an